window.products.push({"id":781101,"name":"Messermeister San Moritz Elite Spear Point Paring Knife, Black, 4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GWnlOQU-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Messermeister San Moritz Elité knife collection have a completely molded, ergonomic and contemporary handle. The blade, bolster and tang are one-piece, hot-drop, hammer forged from a single billet of the finest German steel alloy. Featuring a unique personalization plate, this series of knives will be a statement piece in any kitchen. San Moritz Elité knives are handcrafted individually by 3rd and 4th generation cutlery artisans in Solingen, Germany. You will find yourself using the Messermeister San Moritz Elité 4”Paring Knife daily for a variety of tasks requiring accuracy. This knife has a fine edge blade that tapers to a point and is designed to be an all-purpose knife, similar to a chef's knife, except smaller. The compact blade and molded handle will facilitate trimming, peeling and slicing of produce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GWnlOQU-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messermeister","source_asin":"B06Y436WRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y436WRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y436WRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781102,"name":"Jmr Usa Inc. Waffle Weave Thermal Bed Blanket Twin Comforter Cotton Throw Blankets for Bed, Sofa, Bedroom Decor, Housewarming Gifts, Layering of Hotel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GT903ILXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your All Season Blanket Have a perfect addition to your bed blankets or bedroom decor with the perfect craftsmanship from JMR. This cozy and fluffy waffle weave blanket is knitted to create a subtle texture to soothe you in the morning and tuck you in at night. With a generous size of 66” x 90”, this twin size blanket is available in six trendy colors that add splash to your home decor while keeping you warm and comfortable all year round. Comfortable & Lightweight Blanket To accompany you with outdoor activities of all kinds, you need a blanket that is both functional and lightweight. This thermal blanket is made of 100% cotton for the perfect balance between warmth and breathability. Its medium weight of 3 lbs gives the ideal blend of coziness without drowning from a heavy blanket. Bring this to any occasion to easily wrap up 2 adults. Breathable Waffle Knit Blanket With its exquisite waffle weave design and double stitch edges,this cotton blanket is not just designed with elegance but with continuous air flow mechanism. This embossed and fluffy waffle blanket drapes over your body softly, keeping you secured and relaxed throughout the day. Multipurpose & Snag-Free Our full size blanket works great as a throw on the end of your bed or a drape on your bedroom chair. You can have this as an accent to your home decoration, as your summer blanket or an extra layer during cold months. This can be your snag-free white blanket for repeated use with your hotel and hospital bed sheets. Do all what you need and have yourself a stylish throw blanket, a comforting hospital blanket, or as a large blanket for bed, sofa or car during travel. A Gift the Never Fails The reward of warmth and simplicity is what this cotton throw blanket is made for, more than just a decorative accent. It's the perfect gift for a birthday, housewarming, holiday and all occasions in between. Bring a warm and luxurious present to your loved ones with JMR Cotton Thermal Blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GT903ILXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jmr Usa Inc.","source_asin":"B08Z8LRQNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z8LRQNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z8LRQNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
