window.products.push({"id":781176,"name":"VIKMARI Decorative Wall Clocks 14 inch Silent Non Ticking Battery Operated Round Rustic Indoor Wooden Wall Clock for Kids Bedroom,Living Room,Dining R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S63H3P+vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🌷EASY TO READ: Easy and simple design, no frame nor glass cover. Wooden MDF with a thickness of 0.35 inches(about 9mm).Large size dial with clear large numbers, easy to read from all angles! 🌷SILENT NON-TICKING WALL CLOCK: Super-quality battery operated Taiwan SUN 12888 scanning quartz sweep movement guarantees accurate time and absolutely silent environment. 🌷EASY TO HANG: Back slot design offers easy installation, 1 non-trace hook included. Powered by one 1.5V AA battery (not included), please use normal carbon battery. 🌷SUPERB TECHNOLOGY: Wall clock covered by a colorful and delicate surface coated paper. A layer of wood veneer is added on the back side to increase the thickness and firmness of the clock. 🌷OCCASION: Wall clock decorative for an office, kitchen, living room, bedroom, classroom, guest room or dining room and so on. This is the best choice for you to decorate your house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S63H3P+vL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIKMARI","source_asin":"B07Z9Z9TGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z9Z9TGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z9Z9TGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781177,"name":"Slow Masticating Juicer, ROVKA High Nutrient and Vitamins Juice Extractor, 3.15 Inches Wide Chute Cold Press Juicer for Fruit, Golden","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-29sASD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ROVKA Slow Masticating Juicer J704 Higher Juice Yield, More Nutrition Value Unique arranged holes help squeezing more juice and preserve more nutrition for you. Low Noise Cold Press Juicer The juicer processes at 60 rpm and 60 db, let you enjoy your comfortable juicing. 80 mm Wide Chute Design with 80 mm wide chute for more easy putting ingredients into the slow juicer, save more preparation time and help reduce cleanup time. Make Everything Easier Detachable Auger Design make it easier to take apart the filter and auger, easier cleaning all parts of the slow masticating juicer. Longer Product Life Design with reverse function and overload protection system make our juicer machine have a longer product life. Specification: Product Size: 7.8 x 5.9 x 20 inches Voltage:110-120 Volt Frequency: 50/60 Hz RPM: 65 rpm Weight: 8.8 lb Power cord length: 63 inch After-Sales Service Mailbox: argusleappliance@gmail.com ▲Note: ■ There will be a bit pulp in the juice. It's common that the pulp in the juice and it's good for pulp lovers. ■ The ingredients should not be too hard or too soft. Too hard ingredients like beetroots, gingers and veggies like celery, they should be cut thinly or their fibers will clog the pulp spout. Too soft ingredients like bananas, mangoes are difficult to squeeze. ■ Because it is a household juicer, it is recommended not to use the juicer for more than 20 minutes and the motor would shot down automatically due to the overload protection system. Please let it cool down for an hour and it would work again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-29sASD2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Argus Le","source_asin":"B08Z453YPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z453YPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z453YPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
