window.products.push({"id":781263,"name":"ToyerBee Felt Christmas Tree for Toddlers, Kids Wall Christmas Tree Craft Decorations, 3.5 FT DIY Hanging Felt Tree with 29 Pcs Ornaments for New Year","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816hL0eyPNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Felt Christmas Tree for Toddlers: DIY felt Christmas tree set with 29 detachable ornaments (Santa Claus, snowman, snowflake, Christmas socks, Christmas hat, candies, angel, bells, gift boxes etc.) is suitable for kids as a great stocking filler. Give your little kids felt Christmas decorations kit to get them into the Christmas spirit, and add extra Christmas magic to your home this year. Attractive Ornaments: The detachable ornaments on the hanging tree are carefully designed to cover all Christmas elements, which are lovely and colorful. Different patterns and detachable ornaments are cute toys for boys and girls. Decorating the little tree can keep your toddlers busy during the holiday, and boost the cognitive ability and creativity of your kids. Sturdy DIY Craft Kit: Magic tape on both surfaces of tree and ornaments make the accessories easy to stick and won't fall off easily. Kids can take them off and rearrange the ornaments many times to decorate their own Christmas tree with the way they like for the open-ended activity. A new Christmas tradition for children! Safe & Reusable Felt Fabric: Our felt Christmas tree for kids wall is made of safe felt, no smell, harmless for kids to play with. And the tree is thick and durable enough for vertical hanging and reusing. The kids felt Christmas tree kit is a special way to keep your toddlers busy but also cheerful during the holiday. (The felt Christmas tree is folded for transportation, and it will go back to its original state after steaming or ironing.) Creative Holiday Gift and Decorations: With a sturdy hanging strap on the top, you could hang the kids Christmas tree on walls, doors, windows or any surface to decorate your home. It is also a fantastic Christmas gift for your kids or grandkids. Vibrant colors, multiple ornaments and felt fabric let the Christmas tree gift catch children’s eyes at first sight and create an amazing festival atmosphere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816hL0eyPNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ToyerBee","source_asin":"B0963BP227","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0963BP227","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0963BP227","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
