window.products.push({"id":781430,"name":"Soulhand Cold Brew Coffee Maker, Iced Coffee Maker with Airtight Lid, Cold Brew Pitcher with Removable Stainless Steel Filter for Ready To Drink Iced ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d3V8OhxWL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"☕LARGE CAPACITY: The Soulhand cold brew maker holds 1500ml water and coffee ground up to 150g, which means the highest ratio of coffee to water could be 1:10. If the brew ratio isn't quite to your taste, adjust it up or down until you hit the perfect balance. ☕READY TO DRINK: Making a finished cold brew black coffee straight out of this cold brew coffee maker can actually save your time in the busy morning. There is no need to serve the coffee with some extra fresh water each time or use other coffee brewing equipment, just pour and enjoy. ☕DETACHABLE SUPER-FINE FILTER: Made of food-safe stainless steel, the filter of cold brew coffee maker features many micron holes and effectively filters coffee grounds. It is removable from lid when the cold brewing is finished. Easy to clean and put back together. ☕AIRTIGHT LID FOR STORAGE: The dual silicone sealing lips on the lid prevents unexpected smells and preserves the freshness of the cold brew coffee while storing in the fridge for several days. ☕FOR COLD BREW, HOT TEA & PUNCH: The borosilicate glass pitcher allows extreme temperature changes, functioning well with cold brew coffee or hot infused tea. Thanks to the wide opening, this iced coffee maker even can be used for punch (fruits drink) brew.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d3V8OhxWL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOUL HAND","source_asin":"B07HF215QR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HF215QR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HF215QR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
