window.products.push({"id":781479,"name":"Large Merry Christmas Banner | Outdoor Red Christmas Banner Decorations | Xmas Outdoor & Indoor Hanging Decor | Christmas Holidays Party Decor Supplie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dd6X8n8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester BEAUTIFUL CHRISTMAS DECORATIONS -- Celebrate the Christmas with your loved ones and friends by using this \"Merry Christmas\" banner. An excellent banner which brings the real fun and unforgettable memory at your Christmas holidays party, is Perfect for Christmas party, home decor, office decor, school decor, holiday decor or any occassion during the Christmas. UNIQUE DESIGN -- This Merry Christmas banner is the perfect centerpiece for your Christmas holiday decor. The \"Merry Christmas\" letters, Snowman, Sleigh, Christmas Tree, Santa, Christmas ball, snowflake are printed on the red polyester banner. Each element is completely detailed and decorated to coordinate with the christmas theme and decor, which will add great touch during your Christmas holiday. DURABLE & REUSABLE MATERIAL -- The Merry Christmas banner is made of high quality, sturdy and thick polyester, which is so durable enough that you can use it for a long time.This gorgeous Merry Christmas banner will definitely make a your party treat fabulously funny. LARGE MERRY CHRISTMAS BANNER -- The large Merry Christmas banner measures approx 8.2ft ×1.5ft, the straps on the corner are about 19.7\", large and perfect size design makes it easy to decorate your party, hang the lovely Merry Christmas banner on your party for the perfect Christmas decorations. EASY TO USE --This durable Merry Christmas banner has straps on the each corner, long enough and sturdy, you just need spend a few minutes to find an ideal place and hang it up. You can hang it on the wall, on your yard, ceiling, in a doorway, window, archway and any place your want, or as a backdrop when you take photos.After use, you can fold it up to easy to storage for next time use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dd6X8n8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Partyprops","source_asin":"B07Z3544R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z3544R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z3544R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
