window.products.push({"id":781855,"name":"Romertopf Rectangular Bread Reston Lloyd Natural Glazed Clay, Tan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cvRAtK1qL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","description":"Reston Lloyd was founded in 1972 and produces high quality enamel on steel kitchen, melamine, and acrylic accessories to produce Corelle coordinates as well as their private brand Calypso Basics. In addition, Reston Lloyd is the exclusive distributor for both Romertopf and Mawa which are home & kitchen products from Germany. These high end quality products are one of the corner stones to Reston Lloyd, who focus on quality merchandise from Germany. German made Glazed Romertopf, has a glazed bottom and unglazed lid. The steaming method used by Romertopf surprises you time and time again by its unequalled tasty and healthy dishes and by being extremely easy to use. Each piece is handcrafted in Germany using natural clay. The glazed bottom is made of a glass frit material and does not contain any non-stick chemicals. This allows for easy release and clean up. Contains no lead, cadmium, dyes or plastics. All natural and European tested. Dishwasher and microwave safe and oven safe to 900 Degrees F. Not for freezer use. The rectangular bread loaf pan has been designed to make perfect bread with a crispy top every time, no presoaking is necessary. Romertopf has lasted the test of time because it is easy to use and nutritious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cvRAtK1qL._AC_SL1181_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reston Lloyd","source_asin":"B00DU4LZ4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DU4LZ4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DU4LZ4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781856,"name":"CUSMOR 5 Tiers Shoe Rack, Adjustable Shoe Shelf, Space Saving Shoe Storage Organizer, Easy to Assemble, Bamboo Shoe Shelf Organizer for Entryway, Clos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bJTSoVtQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-TIER LARGE CAPACITY: Dimension of 27.56\"Wx9.37\"Dx29.53\"H makes it store up to 15-20 pairs of adult shoes. The shoe rack fits space perfectly and allows your entryway, closet, hallway, living room to stay stylish and orderly organized. EASY TO ASSMENBLE: Innovative one-touch locking design can fix shoe rack within seconds. Adjusting the screws with small hexagona wrench in box will prevent shoe rack from shaking, so as to be more balanced & steady. All takes JUST 3mins. VERSATILE & SPACE SAVING: This adjustable 5-tier shoe rack is not only for your sneaker, slipper, boots, high heels, but also for your books, plants, toys, bags, sundries, etc. It can maximize storage space in the same area & meet your different needs in storage. STURDY & ECO-FRIENDLY: Made of bamboo with eco-friendly paint treatment, the shoe rack is light & moisture-proof. Thickened flat bamboo board make it bear up to 88 lbs sturdily and block dust from shelf above to keep shoes clean. WHAT YOU WILL GET: Premium CUSMOR 5-tier bamboo shoe rack, a small hexagona wrench, welcome guide, worry free & friendly customer service. CUSMOR works on creating warm home for people. Get this ideal gift with confidence. Any question or requirement, we will help you within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bJTSoVtQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSMOR","source_asin":"B08NK3L69C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NK3L69C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NK3L69C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781857,"name":"Yasutomo Pen Gel Xtreme Metallic Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jbwFgHsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YASUTOMO-Gel Xtreme Metallic Pens. These pens feature high quality, water based, acid free and non-toxic pigment gel ink. Great on light or dark papers. This package contains twelve 0.7mm tipped pens. Available in a variety of colors: each sold separately. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jbwFgHsqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yasutomo","source_asin":"B004BPNEVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004BPNEVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004BPNEVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781858,"name":"HERZOME Baby's First Christmas Ornament Gifts 2022 My Very First Christmas Wood Picture Photo Frame Plaque Christmas Tree Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dyv1ki5FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FIRST CHRISTMAS PICTURE FRAME ORNAMENTS FOR BABY. Remember all the joys and emotions from Baby's First Christmas. A picture will bring the memories back every year you hang your photo ornament on the tree. STURDY NATURAL WOOD CRAFT : This Christmas picture frame ornament is made of nice quality natural wood and laser engraved with cute font to make the keepsake last for years. As it is lightweight, it’s so perfect to hang on big or small Christmas tree or hold by your little baby. PERFECT FOR BABY PICTURES. Photo insert measures appr. 1.96\" X 1.96\" / 5cm X 5cm and Ornament Measures appr. 3.93\" X 3.93\" / 10cm X 10cm. Suitable for a wallet size photo and save the trouble of cutting it round to fit the frame because our picture frame back is designed normal square. At the back, it leaves space for you to write down short messages or baby’s name, birth details. BRIGHTEN UP YOUR CHRISTMAS. This little cute wood hanging ornament will make your Christmas tree or any decoration sparkle. The cookie shape with tiny hands and feet pattern and embellished with a small star is so adorable, and when you put into cute little picture, it will definitely catch anyone’s eyes. Comes with red satin ribbon, it is convenient to hang on anywhere you like to create holiday joy. A UNIQUE CHRISTMAS GIFT CHOICE. A baby’s first Christmas is an event to treasure. This Christmas ornament makes an excellent gift for new parents, grandparents, aunts, uncles or other loved ones, always remembering that amazing First Christmas with baby.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dyv1ki5FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HERZOME","source_asin":"B089QJYNP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QJYNP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QJYNP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
