window.products.push({"id":781918,"name":"Mimosa Bar Sign But First Mimosas Gold Banner, Decorations for Bridal Shower Baby Shower Bubbly Bar Champagne Brunch Bachelorette Party Engagement Wed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zxXDTnh+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Elegant and cute】The color of the banner is gold, not only elegant but also cute. Whether an adult or a child, I believe she or he will like this banner. This is an indispensable decoration for your party. And it is absolutely a good photo prop 【Suitable for gift giving】Don't know what gift to send on a Bachelorette party or wedding of your friends ? Send her a \"But First Mimosas\" banner as a present and decorate the party with her. I believe both you and her will enjoy the process 【Premium quality】The \"But First Mimosas\" banner is made of thick and durable card paper, which won't curl easily, and the color is not easy to fall off. In addition, they are absolutely spelled correctly 【Suitable for multiple occasions】The \"But First Mimosas\" banner is suitable for many occasions, such as bridal shower, baby shower, bachelorette party, hen night, engagement party, wedding, graduation fiesta, birthday party, tropical party, indoor or outdoor decorate, and so on 【Complete after-sales】TTSAM is committed to providing customers with cost-effective products and quality services. If you have any questions about our products, you can ask by email. If you are not satisfied with our products, we promise 100% unconditional refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zxXDTnh+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TTSAM","source_asin":"B07SQZWZ2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQZWZ2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQZWZ2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781919,"name":"Povirt Queen Mattress, 10 Inch Innerspring Hybrid Mattress in a Box, 7-Zone Support Cool Queen Bed Mattress with Breathable Soft Knitted Fabric Cover ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UsG2OEvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥇【Breathable & Healthy】With breathable knitted fabric cover and pressure relief wave foam, which makes the sleeping environment cool and comfortable. The foam not contain harmful substances such as formaldehyde, mercury and other heavy metals, Mattress fabrics are all skin-friendly fabrics, also the foam materials has been certified by ISPA, CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 100. 🥇【Dual-Edge Support System】 This queen mattress is designed with an unique 7-ZONE. Springs work independently from each other, effectively absorb sound and vibration, and evenly distribute body weight. It provides excellent support and comfort for your head, shoulder, waist, buttocks and legs. A dual-edge system enforces the firmness of innerspring edge and protect the bed mattress. You won't roll off when sit on the edge of the innerspring mattress. 🥇【Heat dissipation & Motion Isolation】 Airy mesh on side promotes heat dissipation and independently encased coils beneath enhances airflow. The pocket coils are separated by the isolated fabrics and there is little feel of coils underneath, you don't have to worry about waking up your partner every time you climb into or out of bed or change position. The fireproof layer of the mattress is made of flame-retardant non-woven fabric, which does NOT contain any fiberglass. 🥇【Queen Mattress In A Box】 This hybrid mattress is vacuum compressed, rolled into a compact box, and finally delivered to your door, aiming to make it easier for you to handle. It fits all frames such as box springs, flooring, slatted bases, flat platforms. Please kindly wait for 48-72 hours to fully expand, for any potential odors to dissipate. 🥇【Risk-Free Buying】You deserve the best sleep! Each Povirt mattress has a 100 hassle-free night trial. Our warranty covers all manufacturing defects: sagging, dips, waves, bumps, and decompression issues. Any question is welcome! For a better sleeping experience, we recommend rotating the mattress every 2 weeks for the first 3 months and adding a mattress protector or cover to keep it clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UsG2OEvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Povirt","source_asin":"B09XHY9NM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XHY9NM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XHY9NM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781920,"name":"Welhome 100% Cotton Reversible Bath Mat Rug | Blush | 20\" x 34\"| Racetrack Pattern | Absorbent | Super Soft | Comfort | Quick Dry | Durable | Hotel Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K5Q8GDkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMFORTABLE AND REVERSIBLE - Give your bathroom a refreshing look with the Welhome Cotton Reversible Rug that features a reversible racetrack pattern. The comfortable texture offers a dry and cozy place to stand when you step out of the shower. This bath rug is fully reversible with soft 100% cotton material on both sides offering plush comfort to your feet. HIGH ABSORBENCY - Being a high 2300 GSM and 100% Cotton means that these bath rugs absorb maximum moisture very quickly off your feet. Choose from 10 neutral shades that easily mix-and match with any current aesthetic. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY, SOFT AND DURABLE - These high GSM durable plush cotton rugs are very soft to touch and are bound to provide a luxurious feel. The Unique reversibleness of these rugs will allow you to flip over whenever you wish to and keep up the look of your bathroom. MADE IN GREEN - These Reversible Rugs are Oeko-Tex Certified and are Made in Green. Oeko-Tex is an independent Certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. A MADE IN GREEN product ID proves that the product has been tested for harmful substances. It also guarantees that the textile product has been manufactured using sustainable processes under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. WASH CARE - Machine wash separately in warm water with gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry at low temperature. Do not Iron. Do not dry clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K5Q8GDkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B08SHRYLJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SHRYLJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SHRYLJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781921,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Funny Paris, Ooh La La - Paris Themed Photo Booth Props Kit - 10 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AJ+BGXNEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"10-Piece Funny Paris Photo Booth Props Kit INCLUDES 10 Eiffel Tower arrow and speech bubble photo booth props, 10 wooden dowel sticks and adhesives for assembly. EASY ASSEMBLY: Simply attach the printed DIY photo booth props to the wooden dowels with included adhesive and reinforcing stickers. PERFECT FOR ANY CROWD! Photo booth props are fun Paris party supplies for adults and kids - everyone will love the funny sayings on these Paris Themed photo booth props. Take entertaining and shareable party photos while making memories with these funny photo booth props! PARIS DECORATIONS: Many fun ways to use these cute photo booth props! Use as intended and take party photos to share; Add them to vases and floral arrangements as a fun Paris centerpiece; Accent your Paris candy buffet by displaying them in apothecary candy jars; Adhere as direction arrows to walls and guide your guests to the Eiffel Tower party! HIGH-QUALITY: Paris themed photo booth props are professionally printed on thick cardstock paper. They will arrive cut out and ready to assemble with the included wooden dowel sticks and adhesives. MADE IN THE USA: Funny Paris Photo Booth Props Kit is designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AJ+BGXNEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B0746P3LW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746P3LW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746P3LW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
