window.products.push({"id":781931,"name":"Emile Henry Made In France HR Modern Classics Small Rectangular Baker, 11 x 8\", Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C+dHPft0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1850, Emile Henry has produced in France a large range of high quality ceramic cooking utensils. With a 10 year guarantee, our products are made from natural materials and have been designed and manufactured in France, in Southern Burgundy. Emile Henry unveils Modern Classics, an American inspiration and the first significant launch of an Emile Henry collection since the original pie and lasagna dishes debuted in the early '90s. Modern Classics is a range of cookware and bakeware that has been on the drawing boards for many, many months. It is truly an American collection as the shapes, capacities, and dimensions were developed with an eye toward American foods, style and recipes. All of the shapes have been designed from the ground up to attract the American consumer while preserving the intangible design elements and the performance properties of Emile Henry. Deep enough for 4- 6 layers of lasagna or you can make a delicious moussaka or even a tiramisu ! A family dish, it is easy to manipulate thanks to its comfortable handles. All Emile Henry products are made in France and offer a ten years guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C+dHPft0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00YRBG4Q2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YRBG4Q2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YRBG4Q2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":781932,"name":"Happybuy FR-770 Continuous Band Sealer, Automatic Band Sealer with Digital Temperature Control, (Vertical)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ybWNVh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Sealing: Our FRB-770 horizontal continuous sealing machine is suitable for different assembly lines with premium sealing. Sealing speed: 0-16 m/min, sealing width: 0.24-0.6 in/6-15 mm, film thickness: 0.0008-0.3 in/0.02-0.8 mm. The automatic conveyor belt and cooling/heating block both help the machine work more stably and securely. Efficient Printing: This continuous sealing machine is equipped with an embossing wheel and type wheel, which can print date, remark, introduction, logo simultaneously when sealing. Furthermore, this sealer is also compatible with a stripping wheel and smooth wheel to meet your various demands to some extent. All-Metal Construction: Our horizontal bag sealer has a durable iron body with electrostatic spray paint. This all-metal construction ensures the sealer provides a long-life service. In addition, this machine is constructed by a DC copper motor that provides enormous working power. Powerful Control Panel: Automatic control panel is included in this band sealing machine for better operation. Different products need different sealing temperatures and speeds. Our machine can satisfy your working needs quickly because it possesses a thermostatic control, heat seal switch, and speed control knob. Wide Application: This kind of continuous bag sealer is compatible with bags in thickness of 0.02 mm-0.8 mm on both sides, which is applied to the seal of plastic bag, aluminum foil bag, compound bag, and paper bag. As a result, it is widely used in pharmacy, agriculture, industrial, food, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ybWNVh7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happybuy","source_asin":"B09XML3NV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XML3NV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XML3NV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
