window.products.push({"id":781993,"name":"COSTWAY Oil Filled Radiator Heater, 1500W Portable Space Heater with Dual Safe Protections, Adjustable Thermostat & 3 Heating Modes, Electric Oil Heat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D2Av9Z8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀️【Adjustable Thermostat】You can set a desired temperature by twist button and press the button to choose heating modes (600W, 900W, 1500W) according to your room. In addition, our space heater can automatically maintain the ideal temperature through detecting the air temp to save energy and reduce your bills. ☀️【Fast Heating System】Our electric heater with 7 oil-filled sinks can heat your room fast and evenly. Taking the tubular element as heat source and permanent conduction oil as medium, this heater can warm your room in a short time without producing smoke and unpleasant odor. ☀️【Safe Guarantee】This oil heater is equipped with tip-over and overheat protection to ensure your safety while using. If you forget to close the machine or turn it over by accident, this oil radiator heater will shut off automatically. Besides, the fully enclosed oil reservoir means no oil spill and leakage problems. ☀️【Quiet Operation】 Constructed by 7 oil-filled sinks, our small radiator heater warm the cold air by thermal radiation and air circulation. And the warmth it provides is gentler and lasting. So this heater can keep the room snug and cozy without fan noise to disturb your sleep or work. ☀️【Portable Design】 Since its built-in handle and light weight, our room radiant heater can be carried effortlessly from one room to another. And you can move it silently and freely because its 4 universal casters. Plus front cord bracket, you can warp the electric wire tidily and store it easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D2Av9Z8UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B08KLSX21N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KLSX21N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KLSX21N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
