window.products.push({"id":781998,"name":"Homedant 5-Tier Laminated Metal Shelving Unit Adjustable Garage Storage Utility Rack Heavy Duty Shelves Organization Multipurpose Shelf Warehouse Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZlzqmi-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【 Superior Upgrade Laminated Board 】: Say goodbye to worrying about water damage and humidity and flimsy shelves that warp or split. This is not only designed with a much thicker laminated board for durability to withstand water damage and can be used in areas with high humidity but also looks great and feels soft to the touch. Plus, it's easy to manage - if any contaminants get on the surface, simply remove them without any pesky stains or seepage. 🟦 【 COMPATIBLE SHELF WITH OTHERS 】 : This shelf is a 35.9\"W x 18.2\"D. In addition to this unit, the HOMEDANT shelf has various wide sizes with 18.2 inches deep shelf, So it is very useful if you cannot install multiple products of the same size in your space. ※HOMEDANT's other product lines can be found at the bottom of the product page. 🟦【 HEAVY DUTY & STURDY 】 : This 5-tier steel shelving unit is made of high-quality premium steel and Laminated boards from Korea, of which maximum load is 264 lb per shelf (equal distribution). 🟦【 EASY TO ASSEMBLE 】 : No more hiring someone to assemble your shelves for you. With our product, you can assemble it yourself in just 10 minutes without any bolts or nuts. Simply slide and fix the frame into the post hole by lightly pressing it. It's so easy, you can even do it with your bare hands! And if you do need a tool, a rubber hammer is all you need (not included). 🟦【 MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SOLUTION 】 : this shelving unit offers a useful transformation. With the post connector, it can be easily turned into two shorter units that serve as a table, workbench, or corner shelf, or stacked up to create tall shelving for using storage space efficient. It's the perfect solution for those who need to make the most of their limited space without sacrificing efficiency. Don't settle for a basic shelf when you can have a multi-functional storage solution. 🟦【 ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT 】 : Each tier can be adjusted up and down by 1.18 inches, so you can easily adjust up or down to accommodate your need and store items of different sizes. Adjustable height is an essential part of any storage system, and it is the perfect choice for creating functional storage space. 🟦【 VERSATILE SHELF STYLES 】 : With this shelving unit, you're not limited to just one style. Customize it to your heart's content with options like an open-style basic shelf, a shelf with raised edges to prevent items from falling off, or a mixed format shelf for easy access. Whatever your needs may be, this shelf can adapt and create the perfect storage solution for you. For more information and inspiration, check out the video above! 🟦【SMOOTH FINISHING TOUCHES, RUST & SCRATCH PROOF 】 : ① The surface is covered with a premium powder coating that is not only thick but also free of toxic six heavy metals. This not only gives it a clean and polished look but also makes it resistant to rust and scratches. ② This unit comes with sixteen post-caps, which are essential for protecting your floor from getting scratched or damaged during the assembly process. With these finishing touches, you can be sure that your shelving unit will not only look great but also maintain its quality over time. 🟦【 UNIQUE PERK OF HOMEDANT 】: As a thank you for your purchase, we're including a special gift 🎁 of J-Hook, Post Fixing Clip, and Wall Fixing Bracket. We hope you'll find these useful in your organization endeavors and appreciate your loyalty to our brand. 🟦【 PROVIDE ASSEMBLE VIDEO AND PDF FILE 】 : Provides assembly manual & videos to help you understand easier. You can see the assembly video at the top images or download the Installation Manual in \"Product guides and documents\" at the bottom of the product description.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZlzqmi-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEDANT","source_asin":"B09FP2ZB29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-781998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FP2ZB29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FP2ZB29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
